sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box Member Info data distribtion
    actor networkOperator
    participant MGM
    participant Member1 as Changed Member 
    participant Member2 as Other active Members
    
    end
    Member1->>+MGM: re-registration(member info)
 
    alt
     networkOperator->>+MGM: activate changed member
    else
    networkOperator->>+MGM: suspend changed member
    end
    par MGM to Member1
        MGM->>+Member1: update: member1 new status active
    and MGM to Member2
        MGM->>+Member2: update: member1 new status active
   Note over MGM,Member1: data package includes <br/> memberInfo, memberInfo hash, GroupParameters, CPIWhitelist
    end
     loop
     Member2->>+Member2: check memberInfo hash?
    Note over MGM,Member2: If member's calculated hash does not match with the MGM's, then start sync
     Member2->>+MGM: start Sync
     MGM->>+Member2: send list of missing MemberInfos
   end
